---
import StoreLayout from '../../layouts/StoreLayout.astro';
---

<StoreLayout 
  title="Encomenda Confirmada | Ateliê Ótico — Funchal, Madeira"
  description="Obrigado pela sua encomenda no Ateliê Ótico. O pagamento foi confirmado e a fatura enviada por e-mail."
  hideHeader={true}
  hideTopbar={true}
  hideFooter={true}
>
  <div class="checkout-success-container" style="min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 32px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #ffffff;">
    
    <article class="content-page" style="text-align: center; max-width: 540px; width: 100%; background: #ffffff; padding: 40px 32px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); margin: 0;">
      
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <img src="/SVG-Logo-Atelie.svg" alt="Ateliê Ótico" style="height: 36px; width: auto; object-fit: contain;" />
      </div>

      <div style="width: 52px; height: 52px; background: #000000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 20px;">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <p class="content-tag" style="margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #888;" data-i18n-pt="PAGAMENTO CONFIRMADO" data-i18n-en="PAYMENT CONFIRMED">PAGAMENTO CONFIRMADO</p>
      <h1 style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #000;" data-i18n-pt="Obrigado pela sua compra!" data-i18n-en="Thank you for your order!">Obrigado pela sua compra!</h1>
      
      <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        A sua encomenda <strong id="success-order-num" style="color: #000;">#AO-884920</strong> foi registada com sucesso. Enviámos a confirmação detalhada e a fatura para o seu e-mail <strong id="success-email-val" style="color: #000;"></strong>.
      </p>

      <div style="background: #faf9f6; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); padding: 18px 20px; text-align: left; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <h4 style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #777;">Próximos Passos</h4>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #444; line-height: 1.5;">
          A nossa equipa no Funchal irá inspecionar cuidadosamente as suas armações e preparar a embalagem premium com certificado de autenticidade para expedição segura.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/catalogo" class="btn-cookie-solid" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 46px; padding: 0 24px; text-decoration: none; width: auto; flex: 1;" data-i18n-pt="CONTINUAR A COMPRAR" data-i18n-en="CONTINUE SHOPPING">CONTINUAR A COMPRAR</a>
        <a href="/" class="btn-cookie-outline" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 46px; padding: 0 20px; text-decoration: none; width: auto; flex: 1;" data-i18n-pt="PÁGINA PRINCIPAL" data-i18n-en="HOME PAGE">PÁGINA PRINCIPAL</a>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
    const orderId = params.get('order') || Math.random().toString(36).substring(2, 8).toUpperCase();
    const email = params.get('email') || '';

    const orderEl = document.getElementById('success-order-num');
    if (orderEl) orderEl.textContent = `#AO-${orderId}`;

    const emailEl = document.getElementById('success-email-val');
    if (emailEl && email) emailEl.textContent = `(${email})`;
  </script>
</StoreLayout>
